{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IvxQb3755y1795160300.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>寒冷天氣警告生效，正午時分各區氣溫普遍跌至約12度，明早氣溫預料仍然偏低。</p><p></p><p>一股強烈東北季候風，加上一道廣闊雲帶，氣溫顯著下降。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-20-15h37m37s097.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UZcr4XfrJR1795160470.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在紅磡大環山海旁，無阻市民天未亮就落水。亦有市民身穿背心，如常跑步。</p><p></p><p>在中環碼頭，上班族及學生都要添加厚外套。亦有學生出動頸巾保暖。</p><p></p><p>天文台清晨錄得15.3度，是今年入秋以來最低，但越晏越凍，中午跌至13.2度，各區普遍下降至約12度。</p><p></p><p>天文台指加上風寒效應，提醒市民注意保暖。</p><p></p><p>天文台高級科學主任楊漢賢說：「這次的寒潮屬於濕潮，濕的寒潮，即下雨的寒潮，通常都是這樣，日間雲多，密雲，看不到陽光，所以日間氣溫不能回升，加上大風，所以氣溫會持續下降。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-20-15h38m03s360.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gK8aDElYGT1795160486.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台預料，明早氣溫仍然偏低最低13度，隨後一兩日氣溫稍為回升，另一股東北季候風會在下周二抵達華南沿岸，將再度轉涼，亦會有幾陣雨。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.628728+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T19:37:33.266608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:18.352329+00:00","content_hash":"d4caa2a721f08de7924204b715b51869687d1bac24a568405a757a89ffa81858","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.628728+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}